13
00:00:47,862 --> 00:00:52,903
Prokaryotic and eukaryotic organization — Prokaryotic and eukaryotic cells differ in

14
00:00:52,903 --> 00:00:55,723
compartmentalization and internal organization.

15
00:00:55,723 --> 00:01:00,284
Membranes and compartments — Membranes separate internal conditions from the

16
00:01:00,284 --> 00:01:02,324
environment and define organelles.

17
00:01:02,324 --> 00:01:07,185
Organelles and division of labor — Organelles divide cellular work such as energy

18
00:01:07,185 --> 00:01:09,645
capture, protein processing, and storage.

19
00:01:09,645 --> 00:01:14,626
Microscopy and evidence — Microscopy turns cell structure into observable evidence.

20
00:01:14,626 --> 00:01:18,887
